 "hast": "\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-rhea&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;message-demo&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;previewClassName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;h-auto theme-blue&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<p>The <code>Message</code> component lays out a single message in a conversation. It handles the avatar, alignment, header, and footer around the message surface.</p>\n<p>For AI apps, you can render reasoning steps, tool calls and assistant messages using the <code>Message</code> component.</p>\n<h2 id=\"installation\">Installation</h2>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"CodeTabs\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsList\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;cli&#x22;}]\">Command</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsTrigger\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;manual&#x22;}]\">Manual</mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"TabsContent\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;value&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;cli&#x22;}]\"><figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"npx shadcn@latest add message\" __npm__=\"npx shadcn@latest add message\" __yarn__=\"yarn dlx shadcn@latest add message\" __pnpm__=\"pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add message\" __bun__=\"bunx --bun shadcn@latest add message\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#953800\">npx</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-ligh